OL,3,GNEWSAPub manslaughter accused only
OL,4,Apushed dad 'gently'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of killing the man he had
OL,7,Fjust found out was his father in a pub
OL,8,Fbeer garden has told jurors he only
OL,9,Fpushed him "gently".
OL,11,FSteven Shevels, 61, died after hitting
OL,12,Fhis head when he fell behind the
OL,13,FQueen's Head in Willington, County
OL,14,FDurham, on Christmas Eve, Teesside
OL,15,FCrown Court has heard.
OL,17,FMartin Greensmith, 37, who shortly
OL,18,Fbefore the encounter had been told the
OL,19,Fvictim was his biological father,
OL,20,Fdenies manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
